      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i want to make sure i frame it right so i don't sound like im lecturing them too hard. i was thinking of telling them that the language was just a standard part of the literature back then and that the author was just being realistic about what people actually thought and said in that era. do u think that's a fair way to present it to the class?",
